{"id":"attente","lemma":"attente","pos":"noun","rank":1524,"glosses":["wait (the time that one is waiting or the state of waiting)","expectation (act or state of expecting)","shoulder strap insignia"],"ipa":"/a.tɑ̃t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6b/Fr-attente.ogg/Fr-attente.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"attentes"},"formAudio":{"attentes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f1/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-attentes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La longue attente est terminée.","en":"The long wait is over.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"long","l":"long"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Attendez dans la salle d'attente.","en":"Wait in the waiting room.","words":[{"g":"to wait for, to await","l":"attendre"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"room, hall"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Je suis sur la liste d'attente.","en":"I'm on the waiting list.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"list"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Le résultat a dépassé mes attentes.","en":"The result exceeded my expectations.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"outcome"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"outdated"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Je n'avais aucune attente.","en":"I didn't have any expectations.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"none, no-one","l":"aucun"},null]}]}